    and the UNIX - players. If you're playing on a UNIX system and
    you're not the game's administrator or the person who has the
    permission to use debug (Wizard) mode (set at compile--time, I 
    believe) then you will NEVER get into wizard mode (unless you
    can hack into the appropriate account.....)

    On a PC, I believe the above line does work. The instructions are
    in the README file that gets unpacked with everything else when
    you execute the self-unpacking binaries. (not the README.1st (first?)
    file that you can ftp with the binaries -- you must execute the
    binaries (i.e. unpack them) to get the file I'm talking about).

